e, relabeling, and replay checks only to their documented scope. Candidate internal diagnostics are marked unverified. State that original fixed-hinge development evidence is not a matched final comparator, component ablations are absent, and broader stress studies were not performed. A brief nonchronological missing-evidence note may cite the local two-hop branch's evaluation_failure.json and harness_evaluate_stderr.log: disconnection is observed, underlying cause and performance unknown. Do not report campaign counts, winner margins, or search deltas without study.* grounding; do not reinterpret a missing score as a loss.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.qualification.status\",\n        \"final.qualification.outcome\",\n        \"final.qualification.correct\",\n        \"final.metric.control_success_fraction\",\n        \"final.metric.failed_episode_fraction\",\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"heading\": \"LLM Usage\",\n      \"grounded_content\": \"Include the venue-required separate section disclosing documented LLM roles in ideation, candidate-code generation, reference-query planning, framing, writing, and figure preparation as applicable. Use actual process artifacts under results/ideas and the local strategy/agent records; distinguish work already performed from future writing/figure activity. These process artifacts, not scientific metric source IDs, ground the disclosure. Include no author identities, personal links, funding, or acknowledgements.\",\n      \"source_ids\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
